# MOVLI MASTER — PROJECT IDENTITY

## Monorepo structure
- `@movli/shared` — contracts only, no runtime deps, CommonJS output
- `@movli/server` — Express + Socket.IO + Prisma + Redis, CommonJS
- `@movli/client` — React 19 PWA, ESM, Vite 7
- `@movli/e2e` — Playwright only

## Non-negotiables
- Server is authoritative. Client NEVER computes game state.
- Full state sync on every action via `game:state-sync`
- `GameSyncState` changes require update in BOTH client AND server
- `packages/shared` is single source of truth for all types
- After any shared change: `pnpm build:shared` before testing

## Architecture decisions (do not revisit without good reason)
- State machine routing (GameState enum), NOT URL routing
- Socket.IO Redis adapter for multi-node, NOT sticky sessions
- Prisma for all DB operations, NO raw SQL except migrations
- Zod for ALL socket payload validation
- JWT auth, NO sessions/cookies
